@startuml
!include ../_template_styles.puml
' Data to Wisdom pyramid (DIKW Hierarchy)
top to bottom direction

card "**WISDOM**\n<size:15>Applied Knowledge</size>\n\n<size:14>Optimal decisions</size>\n<size:14>based on experience</size>" as W <<Primary>>

card "**KNOWLEDGE**\n<size:15>Skills + Info</size>\n\n<size:14>Patterns &</size>\n<size:14>relationships</size>" as K <<Task>>

card "**INFORMATION**\n<size:15>Context</size>\n\n<size:14>Structured data</size>\n<size:14>with meaning</size>" as I <<Control>>

card "**DATA**\n<size:15>Raw Facts</size>\n\n<size:14>Observations &</size>\n<size:14>measurements</size>" as D <<Schema>>

' Pyramid: Data (base) → Wisdom (apex); arrows show transformation direction
D -up-> I : **Process**
I -up-> K : **Analyze**
K -up-> W : **Apply**

@enduml
